Package: refoRest
Type: Package
Title: Detection and Mapping of Disturbance in Forest Time Series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Anna", "Hehn",
      email = "anna.hehn@stud-mail.uni-wuerzburg.de",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: This package provides tools to detect, analyze and visualize disturbances in remote sensing index time series.
It implements z-score based disturbance detection, spatial patch delineation and automated map and report generation for disturbance events.
